Files inherited from the upstream projects (Mihon, TachiyomiSY, Komikku) keep their original
Apache License 2.0 headers, and the top-level `LICENSE` file is the Apache-2.0 text. Apache-2.0
code may be combined into a GPL-3.0 work, so while the combined distribution is GPL-3.0-or-later,
those individual upstream files remain Apache-2.0 on their own. New komi-kun files for the
Yomitan/OCR port carry an `SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later` header; only the GPL-free
seam files (listed in `AGENTS.md` and in the implementation contract §1.3) stay Apache-2.0 so they
can be contributed back to Komikku.

